{
  "name": "o1js-groth16",
  "description": "An implementation of the Groth16 zk-SNARK verifier tailored for the Mina Protocol's o1js framework. It features complex arithmetic over pairing-friendly elliptic curves, specifically BN254, utilizing non-native field gadgets to perform Miller loops and final exponentiations. The project enables Mina smart contracts to verify Circom-generated SNARK proofs by providing the necessary cryptographic primitives for cross-curve pairing operations.",
